cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "odeuropa-eokg-mcp"
abstract: >
  An MCP server providing AI-mediated access to the European Olfactory
  Knowledge Graph (EOKG) built by the Odeuropa project, supporting full-text
  search of smell references, vocabulary concepts, smell profiles over time,
  and viewing artworks with their detected smell-related objects.
